derful and so swoony at times, if we ignore the hygiene situation in the wilderness. 😅\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe only thing I wasn't happy about is the ending, or rather how the things were resolved. I wasn't a fan of that in the first book, either.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e******\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eRe-read 12/2025\u003c/b\u003e via audiobook. Another great narration by Gary Furlong.","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A11KBHDCZHJVGK\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG\"}}"},"likeCount":120,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":25},"User:7999417":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":7999417,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1757268654i/7999417._UX200_CR0,42,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1272,"textReviewsCount":3706,"name":"~ Dαni(ela) ♥ ♂♂ \u0026 semicolons ~","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/7999417-d-ni-ela-semicolons","contributor":null,"id":7999417},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A22ZFSGBSO54AZ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A22ZFSGBSO54AZ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A22ZFSGBSO54AZ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A22ZFSGBSO54AZ","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A22ZFSGBSO54AZ"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/7999417?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"best-hea","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/7999417?shelf=best-hea"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"british-boys","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/7999417?shelf=british-boys"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"enemies-to-lovers","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/7999417?shelf=enemies-to-lovers"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"m-m","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/7999417?shelf=m-m"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"best-mm-romance-2021-2024","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/7999417?shelf=best-mm-romance-2021-2024"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6191032964"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.Lxfl27I5XMgEYzFrtMeeNA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.Lxfl27I5XMgEYzFrtMeeNA","creator":{"__ref":"User:7999417"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1780953049457,"createdAt":1723330108752,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1723341513187,"text":"\u003cb\u003e~4.5~\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJust as good as the first book, \u003cem\u003eThe Unlikely Pair\u003c/em\u003e is all that and a bag of chips:\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e- Enemies-to-lover\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e- Opposites attract\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e- Political intrigue \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e- Danger, survival, and the call of the wild\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e- Cozy Finnish cabin \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e- Witty banter\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e- Slow burn, followed by fiery passion\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e- HEA for Toby and Harry, but the \"mystery\" aspect of the plot (who was behind the men's kidnapping?) won't be resolved until book 3 (can't wait!)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhat I loved most about this book is the complex and believable way Harry and Toby move from pure animosity to tolerance to grudging respect to lovers to a necessity as essential as breathing.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOne of the story's takeaways is that while we can agree to disagree about the tax code or infrastructure funding or the best way to cook an egg, there should be no disagreements about the fundamental right of all people to be their true selves, live free from oppression, and love whom they choose to love. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThat's not politics. That's morals. Someone's very existence should never be up for debate.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBut big spoon vs. little spoon? Now, that's debatable. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\n  \u003cblockquote\u003e\"I am decidedly a big spoon,\" Harry says firmly. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"Well then, I'm an ice cream scoop.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"You're a what?\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"An ice cream scoop. Big enough to envelop all spoons of any size.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"I'm an inch taller than you, Toby.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"Ah, but my ice cream scoop persona is more about my personality than my size.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"Fine, if you're an ice cream scoop, I'm a soup ladle.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"Actually, I think you're more of a salad fork.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"Exactly how am I a salad fork?\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\"Formal, rarely needed, and incredibly pretentious.\"\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A22ZFSGBSO54AZ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG\"}}"},"likeCount":71,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":10},"User:156242339":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":156242339,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1749308684i/156242339._UX200_CR0,23,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":664,"textReviewsCount":966,"name":"Brooke","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/156242339-brooke","contributor":null,"id":156242339},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3N7BIT1G6ZJW9":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3N7BIT1G6ZJW9"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3N7BIT1G6ZJW9\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3N7BIT1G6ZJW9","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3N7BIT1G6ZJW9"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/156242339?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"enemies-to-lovers","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/156242339?shelf=enemies-to-lovers"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"rom-com-low-angst","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/156242339?shelf=rom-com-low-angst"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"five-stars","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/156242339?shelf=five-stars"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"grr-arc","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/156242339?shelf=grr-arc"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"mm-contemporary","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/156242339?shelf=mm-contemporary"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6717335123"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.kHiiNzkmvsaset7DWFcWpA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.kHiiNzkmvsaset7DWFcWpA","creator":{"__ref":"User:156242339"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1782681177253,"createdAt":1722878811060,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1722878815098,"text":"\u003cu\u003e⭐️ 5 stars ⭐️\u003c/u\u003e \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003ci\u003e « Instead of fuck buddies, do fuck enemies exist? » \u003c/i\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e 𖠰 What could be worse than being hunted by terrorists in the wilderness with your annoying rival? Falling in love with him. 𖠰 \u003c/b\u003e \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI think I loved Toby and Harry’s story more than book one. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eThe lines between love and hate getting blurred, anger turning into passion, living each moment as if it’s your last. And snuggling to conserve body warmth? Yes please, to all of the above.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003eJax Calder\u003c/i\u003e turned up the heat in this installment, and I for one am loving it. \u003ci\u003e[Even though I am definitely not experiencing a Scandinavian winter at the moment, but rather a melting Italian summer, give me all the heat. Burn me up, baby.]\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003ci\u003e || Toby and I didn’t merely fall in love. We fell into a profound, unfathomable love, \u003cu\u003ethe kind of love where your souls mesh together and trying to separate them will permanently wound you\u003c/u\u003e. ||\u003c/i\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTheir story was not only filled with heat and banter, but also some heart-clenching action moments. And each life-risking moment just brought them closer together. \u003cbr /\u003eI loved the little acts of care between them, how even if they ‘hated’ each other, they still trusted each other, protected each other, saved each other. \u003cbr /\u003eAnd the love declaration was low key epic. Not gonna lie, I got emotional there for a sec. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI can’t wait for the next installment, because I’m a sucker for a good bodyguard romance. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003ci\u003e “We handled a sprint through the Scandinavian wilderness. I’m fairly certain we can handle anything together.”\u003c/i\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003eI received a copy of this book from Gay Romance Reviews, and this is my honest review.\u003c/i\u003e \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\n  \u003cu\u003eCW and tropes (spoilers):\u003c/u\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e \u003cbr /\u003e- Enemies/political rivals to lovers \u003cbr /\u003e- Forced proximity \u003cbr /\u003e- Homophobia (off page)\u003cbr /\u003e- Mentions of past physical abuse \u003cbr /\u003e- Mentions of parental death/grief (off page) \u003cbr /\u003e- Snuggling to keep warm \u003cbr /\u003e- Adultery (not between MCs)\u003cbr /\u003e- Vers MCs ","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3N7BIT1G6ZJW9\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG\"}}"},"likeCount":55,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":12},"User:59820503":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":59820503,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1474916365i/59820503._UY200_CR78,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":250,"textReviewsCount":1634,"name":"Drache.... (Angelika) ","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/59820503-drache-angelika","contributor":null,"id":59820503},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A21MYX6GJ8GQGN":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A21MYX6GJ8GQGN"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A21MYX6GJ8GQGN\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A21MYX6GJ8GQGN","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A21MYX6GJ8GQGN"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/59820503?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6008139827"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.5_uzk8_-qiN0zMe1a6vuCg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.5_uzk8_-qiN0zMe1a6vuCg","creator":{"__ref":"User:59820503"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1782681187119,"createdAt":1723309566255,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1723309702329,"text":"2,75 stars. \u003cbr /\u003e2 stars for the first part in the wilderness and some overall-issues I had, and 4 stars for the last part. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eA few thoughts... \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBoth MCs were in their late thirties, but they acted/talked like twenty-somethings. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHarry's wife being aromantic and asexual didn't feel like genuine ace-rep, more like a convenient prop for 95% of the book. Not good. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI guess the first book in the series maxed out my ability to switch my brain off, when faced with OTT/impossible plot decisions.. You'd think an author who writes a novel about 2 men surviving in the scandinavian wilderness would do some basic research, or think things through, because:\u003cbr /\u003e-soaked-through trousers can't dry in a few hours simply because they are put near a self build fire, when the sun alone is too weak to dry them, and it's chilly outside. Twice a day no less. Even the heavy coat was nearly dry! \u003cbr /\u003e-the first 3-4 days they ate each one granola bar a day, then the following days they started fishing, and between them they ate for several days 3 fish a day.. and had \"their stomachs full\"... grown man, walking all day long, several days in a row, in the woods. Yeah, no way. \u003cbr /\u003e-bleeding blisters can't heal over night so you can put on shoes and walk for hours the next day, just because they're left for a few hours to dry.. unless you're a wolf shifter, but the MCs in this book weren't wolf shifters (might have solved them some problems, though, lol). \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTalk about OTT:\u003cbr /\u003e-a 15 year old animosity because of legitimate contradictory political believes just melts away. \u003cbr /\u003e-while hiding from helicopters/men with machine guns hunting them, the MCs get aroused because they're forced in close proximity for the first time? \u003cbr /\u003e-the survival kit held miraculosly everything they needed at the moment. I was waiting for the moment they would find condoms and lube in there..\u003cbr /\u003e-when they started quoting holocaust survivor Elie Wiesel and Martin Luther King while building a fire, I may have damaged my eyes rolling them.. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIt's a shame, really.. had the author not decided to take at every plot-decision-point the most exagerated turn, this would have been better in my opinion.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI DID enjoy the last 25% a lot, though. That part was lovely.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e(but.. why didn't we get any satisfactory explanation who had been behind the assassination attempt?)","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A21MYX6GJ8GQGN\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG\"}}"},"likeCount":37,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":19},"User:95700004":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":95700004,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1729002038i/95700004._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":31,"textReviewsCount":838,"name":"Lily S ☀️⛱️\u0026#x1f41a;\u0026#x1f980;","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/95700004-lily-s-x1f41a-x1f980","contributor":null,"id":95700004},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2BDJDCEAGTY7L":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2BDJDCEAGTY7L"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2BDJDCEAGTY7L\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2BDJDCEAGTY7L","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2BDJDCEAGTY7L"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/95700004?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"arc","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/95700004?shelf=arc"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"enemies-to-lovers","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/95700004?shelf=enemies-to-lovers"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"gay-romance-reviews","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/95700004?shelf=gay-romance-reviews"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"favorites-of-2024","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/95700004?shelf=favorites-of-2024"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"looking-forward-to-next-in-series","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/95700004?shelf=looking-forward-to-next-in-series"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6707775843"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.rAT5PwSQdbcoRkKlJQEa_g":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.rAT5PwSQdbcoRkKlJQEa_g","creator":{"__ref":"User:95700004"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1777022805806,"createdAt":1722630423310,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1723067708566,"text":"I absolutely adored this! After reading The Royal Heir I think this setting, mostly in the Scandinavian wilderness, was a nice change. Most of the book is Toby and Harry trying to survive and having to rely on each other when they are political enemies and certainly not fond of each other. Their relationship grows out of necessity but their feelings grow from so much more. It was so sweet watching these two stripped down so that they couldn’t hide from each other. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere is so much pining in this too and it stressed me out! I really appreciate the way the author writes a complete story and doesn’t rush anything. We need to see these men after their rescue to understand what is on the line. I was very invested in the political conundrum which really surprised me since I hate politics in my books. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI loved the way Toby and Harry argued, it was done with respect and didn’t stop even after they fell for each other. These are two nature men who are professionals but also understand that they will not see eye to eye on everything. I wish more people were like this in real life.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI am super excited that we get Nicholas next year! I really was hoping he’d get a story plus we get a continuation of a part of this book that isn’t finished yet. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e**I received an ARC for review\u003cbr /\u003e*All thoughts and opinions are my own","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2BDJDCEAGTY7L\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG\"}}"},"likeCount":39,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":8},"User:2998678":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":2998678,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1745279085i/2998678._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":190,"textReviewsCount":1596,"name":"Gaby","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/2998678-gaby","contributor":null,"id":2998678},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1L10J42J4J7JH":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1L10J42J4J7JH"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1L10J42J4J7JH\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1L10J42J4J7JH","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1L10J42J4J7JH"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2998678?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"2024","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2998678?shelf=2024"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"contemporary-fiction","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2998678?shelf=contemporary-fiction"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"mm-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2998678?shelf=mm-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"queer","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2998678?shelf=queer"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"nordic-scandinavia","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2998678?shelf=nordic-scandinavia"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"politics","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2998678?shelf=politics"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"2025","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2998678?shelf=2025"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5827495137"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.X7WY6lqT1PxMfAL1QL5_8Q":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.X7WY6lqT1PxMfAL1QL5_8Q","creator":{"__ref":"User:2998678"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1777022820113,"createdAt":1725047720766,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1758558521970,"text":"NGL, the first time I read this book, I thought they spent a lot of time stranded in the Scandinavian wilderness, and I couldn’t see how they were going to escape/ be rescued. But this time around, I didn’t feel that way and really liked their survival adventures.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThen I figured that their being in this forced proximity situation actually made for good character development, as we were able to get to know who the real Toby and Harry were besides their political personas. While being forced to rely on each other for literal life-or-death situations, this stubborn pair managed to pass from determined antagonistic rivals to wholesome lovers slowly.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHonestly, the little acts of service they did for each other all the time were so thoughtful and a delight to read, I could have read a hundred pages more of them just playing house.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAfter they were inevitably brought back to civilization, I was as afraid and sad as Toby, as I couldn’t see a way forward for them. I was glad when Harry decided not to make the same mistake as his dad and brought their HEA to life.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSo yeah, I enjoyed this book and it made me miss \u003cb\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://goodreads.com/book/show/179592122.The_Unlikely_Heir__Unlikely_Dilemmas___1_\" title=\"The Unlikely Heir (Unlikely Dilemmas, #1) by Jax Calder\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eThe Unlikely Heir\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/b\u003e and now I can’t wait to read the next one and finally find out the reason behind the conspiracy of the kidnapping.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Sh