ey disagree on the specifics of almost everything known to man. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe fish? The fires? The survival blanket? Man had Toby discovering a competence kink he never knew he had.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDon't even get me started on the grand gestures between these two. I love impossible love that finds a way. Romeo and Juliet minus the stupidity.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis book has very different vibes from the usual Jax Calder (minus the ever present humor) but I have to say I'm VERY pleasantly surprised.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A17M60JLLRVQ8S\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG\"}}"},"likeCount":10,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:32080420":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":32080420,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1784673492i/32080420._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":335,"textReviewsCount":1009,"name":"Julia (bookish.jka)","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/32080420-julia-bookish-jka","contributor":null,"id":32080420},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2D7RJ3OHHLDGR":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2D7RJ3OHHLDGR"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2D7RJ3OHHLDGR\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2D7RJ3OHHLDGR","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2D7RJ3OHHLDGR"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/32080420?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","ta