e villains of the piece. \u003cbr /\u003eI loved every moment of this book which had me hooked from the very beginning. The intriguing plot is perfectly balanced with the romance element and the mixture of sweet and steam is perfect. There’s some angst but nothing that can’t be overcome as Toby and Harry get their well deserved and hard earned HEA. \u003cbr /\u003eWe are also left with a peek at the characters in the next instalment. This is where we also learn who is responsible for all that happened to Toby and Harry. \u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2CD3Z20J5SYBT\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG\"}}"},"likeCount":9,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:1133802":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":1133802,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1398440418i/1133802._UY200_CR25,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":227,"textReviewsCount":1878,"name":"Fani *loves angst*","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/1133802-fani-loves-angst","contributor":null,"id":1133802},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A28Y67WJFLPDXP":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A28Y67WJFLPDXP"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A28Y67WJFLPDXP\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A28Y67WJFLPDXP","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A28Y67WJFLPDXP"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.JCB4XHW0oW5d8wQG"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/1133802?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"